// An injection attribute in a file without a package clause cannot be enabled
// by adding @extern alone, as @extern requires a package clause too.
-- cue.mod/modules.cue --
-- no_package.cue --
Foo: _ @testfn(file.xx, abi=c, sig="func(int)int")

-- out/extern --
@testfn attribute requires a package clause and a file-level @extern(testfn) declaration:
    ./no_package.cue:1:8
